flavor = "A disc cut from an oak that fell of its own weight in the deep Whisperwood — Lyra harvested the wood with her hands in the leaf-mould and apologized aloud to Thiar the Stag before she touched it. Strung on a cord she dyed in marshmint water. Worn next to the skin, it warms quickly. That is haelen, she will say, and not magic."
